Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(1000,0)\fs40\pos(192,171)\c&HD6D6D6&}米琼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\rEng}We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以前常常坐在屋顶上\N{\rEng}He used to sit on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\rEng}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\rEng}Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}欢迎来到亚历山大安全区\N迷途者的天堂  掠夺者的地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他是什么意思\N{\rEng}What do you think he meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他希望我们停止反抗救世军吗\N{\rEng}Did he want us ‭to stop fighting the Saviors?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向尼根投降吗\N{\rEng}Just... surrender to Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以靠边停车\N{\rEng}We could pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看他写了什么\N{\rEng}We could read what he wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  现在还不行  我不能看\N{\rEng}No. Not yet. Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\rEng}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他  卡尔\N{\rEng}He -- Carl... He...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给尼根写了封信\N{\rEng}wrote a letter to Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得和简迪斯谈谈\N{\rEng}I need to talk to Jadis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有武器  人手\N{\rEng}They have weapons... people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能就此放弃\N{\rEng}We can't just give that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是现在\N{\rEng}Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跟我去了救世堂\N{\rEng}They went with me to the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军看到了我们\N{\rEng}The Saviors saw us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也会成为目标\N{\rEng}They're gonna be a target, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们仍需要他们\N{\rEng}We still need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是我们的盟友  不是他们的\N{\rEng}They're ours, not theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(1000,0)\fs40\pos(192,171)\c&HD6D6D6&}尼根
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们监视了山顶寨  道路什么的\N{\rEng}Hilltop is covered. The roads and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在外面  所以我们要深入搜索\N{\rEng}They are out there somewhere, so let's get balls deep
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可能躲藏的每个旮沓角落\N{\rEng}in every nook and cranny they might hole up in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,角落  裂缝和洞穴  各位\N{\rEng}Nooks, crannies, and holes, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能藏人的任何鬼地方\N{\rEng}All that shit outside the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们亚历山大的朋友们\N{\rEng}Appears our friends at Alexandria
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.23,0:09:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄了个逃跑计划\N{\rEng}had themselves an escape plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.39,0:09:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克的独眼心肝宝贝耍了我\N{\rEng}Rick's little one-eyed pride and joy played me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子  就是为末世而生的\N{\rEng}That kid -- ‭That kid is built for this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我出去了结这一切\N{\rEng}Let me go out and close this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿拉特已经去了\N{\rEng}Arat's got it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山顶寨情况如何\N{\rEng}How'd the Hilltop go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照要求做了\N{\rEng}As requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\rEng}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再加一句好样的\N{\rEng}With an extra attaboy on top
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我知道你不想那样\N{\rEng}given I know you didn't want to play it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有加文的消息吗\N{\rEng}You hear anything om Gavin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.73,0:10:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有  但是快了\N{\rEng}Not yet, but it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.47,0:10:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加文或许一辈子都郁郁寡欢\N{\rEng}Gavin may be perpetually pissed off,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他向来能把分内工作做好\N{\rEng}but he keeps his shit dry and tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如不需要我去追捕瑞克一伙\N{\rEng}If I'm not running down Rick and company,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备让我去干什么\N{\rEng}where do you want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捡破烂的那群人\N{\rEng}Garbage people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\rEng}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消灭那群叛徒也许会...\N{\rEng}Eliminating those who reneged might...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.61,0:11:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们弹药不足\N{\rEng}leave us a tad short on ammo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还是值得的\N{\rEng}but it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你听好了  西蒙\N{\rEng}I need you to hear me on this, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些无耻的叛徒也许两面三刀\N{\rEng}Those piss-stained double-crossers may have pulled a triple cross,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这也不能改变他们是个好资源的事实\N{\rEng}but it doesn't change the fact that they are still a resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你得把那口翻腾上来的老血咽下去\N{\rEng}So you're gonna choke back whatever shit ‭is stirring up inside you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去提醒他们  和救世军的协议\N{\rEng}and remind them ‭that a deal with the Saviors
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是坚不可摧的\N{\rEng}is a lock, stock, suck my barrel deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:39.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发出警告  杀鸡儆猴\N{\rEng}Deliver the standard message, take one out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人自然会听话\N{\rEng}and the rest will fall in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只杀一个就好  西蒙\N{\rEng}Just one, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:11:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么想说的...\N{\rEng}If you've got something to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就直说吧\N{\rEng}say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们应该及时止损\N{\rEng}Maybe we should cut our losses here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人永远学不乖\N{\rEng}These people can't learn the lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论我们给他们多少次教训\N{\rEng}no matter how many times we teach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚历山大  山顶寨\N{\rEng}Alexandria, Hilltop,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神之国  捡破烂的...\N{\rEng}Kingdom, these garbage rats --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.04,0:12:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们像是不了解情况一样\N{\rEng}they're not seeming ‭to understand the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.04,0:12:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都不了解\N{\rEng}Not one little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以也许我们该吸取一下教训\N{\rEng}So maybe we learn our lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把残渣清理掉\N{\rEng}scrape the plates into the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去更远的地方\N{\rEng}Move further out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找其他的社区...\N{\rEng}Find other communities to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去"拯救"\N{\rEng}"save."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在是使出了浑身的劲\N{\rEng}Oh, I am doing my best
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才忍住没笑出来\N{\rEng}to hold it together right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想止你的损  一意孤行\N{\rEng}You wanna cut your losses, take your own advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠杀光所有人来解决问题...\N{\rEng}Killing everybody to solve the problem --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是简单的方法\N{\rEng}that is the easy way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是我们的方法\N{\rEng}not our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的所作所为...\N{\rEng}What we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救众生  是很不容易\N{\rEng}saving people, it is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但却他妈的很有效果\N{\rEng}But it damn well works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近可没有\N{\rEng}Not lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦我解决了瑞克\N{\rEng}Once I clip Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都会归位  西蒙\N{\rEng}everything's aces again, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rEng}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他妈是什么\N{\rEng}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.39,0:13:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从山顶寨送来的\N{\rEng}A delivery from the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你带了工具来处理它\N{\rEng}I brought you something to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上好膛了\N{\rEng}It's charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去\N{\rEng}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}我们还有38个人质  别轻举妄动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再打开一点\N{\rEng}Little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是迪恩\N{\rEng}That's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这意味着山顶寨的另外38个人质\N{\rEng}That means the other "38" that the Hilltop are holding
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是卫星站的\N{\rEng}are from the Satellite Outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我的人\N{\rEng}Those are my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要杀光那些农夫\N{\rEng}I'm gonna kill ‭every last one of those farmers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只能做我交代的事\N{\rEng}You will do exactly what I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能让他们逍遥法外\N{\rEng}We can't let 'em get away with this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只能做\N{\rEng}You will do...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你分内的事\N{\rEng}your job!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(1000,0)\fs40\pos(192,171)\c&HD6D6D6&}伊妮德
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.67,0:15:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是来找你们帮忙的\N{\rEng}We came here to ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真不该来\N{\rEng}Well, ‭you shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  能不能...\N{\rEng}Hey. Please. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:32.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  能不能...\N{\rEng}Please. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能谈谈吗\N{\rEng}Let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔尼亚是你的家人\N{\rEng}Natania was your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.66,0:15:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来决定  辛蒂\N{\rEng}It's up to you, Cyndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全听你的\N{\rEng}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该杀了他们\N{\rEng}We should just kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会脱身的\N{\rEng}We're gonna get out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.33,0:16:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是因为那个\N{\rEng}‭This is...it's not about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她逼的  我别无选择\N{\rEng}She made it so I had to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她逼我杀她的\N{\rEng}She made me kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会再做一次的\N{\rEng}I'd do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没得选\N{\rEng}I'd have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管知道会不好受\N{\rEng}Even knowing it would feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带到海滩去\N{\rEng}Take them to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你要杀我们  -带走\N{\rEng}- You're going to kill us? ‭- Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的决定\N{\rEng}This is your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.65,0:17:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要负责\N{\rEng}You own it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:20.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛蒂\N{\rEng}Cyndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀我们  最好不是\N{\rEng}You better have a good reason for killing us
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只为了一时解气\N{\rEng}other than thinking it'll make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为解不了\N{\rEng}Because it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧杀了他们吧\N{\rEng}Let's just get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.45,0:17:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要杀我们\N{\rEng}Why would you kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了惩罚我们吗\N{\rEng}To punish us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:33.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗\N{\rEng}I mean, don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀戮本身就是惩罚\N{\rEng}Killing is the punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你处决我们\N{\rEng}You execute us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们的人可能会来找我们\N{\rEng}then maybe some of ours will come looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你能干掉他们\N{\rEng}And maybe you'll take them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但最终  会来更多的人\N{\rEng}but eventually, ‭enough of them will come back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且消灭你们\N{\rEng}and they will wipe you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你祖母自己害死了自己\N{\rEng}Your grandmother got herself killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以别再犯同样的错误了\N{\rEng}so don't make the same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了我们\N{\rEng}Just let us go...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会继续抗争  你们也能继续藏身\N{\rEng}...and we'll keep fighting them and you can keep hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放他们走\N{\rEng}They live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们赢了  你想得到消息吗\N{\rEng}If we win, ‭do you even want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.28,0:18:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就帮我们获胜\N{\rEng}Then help us win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没杀你俩  就是帮你们获胜了\N{\rEng}We're helping you win by not killing you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我们对反抗事业的贡献\N{\rEng}That's our contribution to the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经拿走了我们能给的一切\N{\rEng}You've taken everything else we could give.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再回这里了\N{\rEng}Don't come here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再试图杀陌生人了\N{\rEng}Stop trying to kill strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道我们得杀谁\N{\rEng}We know who we have to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道朋友和敌人之间的区别\N{\rEng}We know the difference between friends and enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也该知道\N{\rEng}You should, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别回来了\N{\rEng}Don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.77,0:19:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道去车子的路怎么走吗\N{\rEng}You know how to get to the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.59,0:19:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚伦  她们不会帮我们\N{\rEng}Aaron, ‭they're not gonna help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:28.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想回家\N{\rEng}I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  胜过一切\N{\rEng}I do, more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不能走\N{\rEng}But I can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们还没加入战斗呢\N{\rEng}Not until they join the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们不会加入的\N{\rEng}They're not joining.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碧翠丝和凯西之前愿意抗争\N{\rEng}Beatrice and Kathy ‭were open to fighting before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我能说服她们  我只是需要时间\N{\rEng}I think I can convince them. I just need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  那我们都留下\N{\rEng}Okay, then we both stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得回去\N{\rEng}You need to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉玛姬发生了什么  我在做什么\N{\rEng}Tell Maggie what's happening, what I'm doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得告诉她别过来\N{\rEng}and you need to tell her not to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.95,0:19:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你回去  她们会杀了你的\N{\rEng}They'll kill you if you go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会回去的\N{\rEng}I won't go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\rEng}It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管发生了什么  我都会没事的\N{\rEng}No matter what happens, I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我保证我们会再见面\N{\rEng}Promise me I'll see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保证\N{\rEng}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我保证你会没事\N{\rEng}Promise me you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\rEng}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(1000,0)\fs40\pos(192,171)\c&HD6D6D6&}西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么\N{\rEng}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要攻击山顶寨吗\N{\rEng}we lighting up the Hilltop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要继续按兵不动\N{\rEng}Gonna sit on our dicks a mite more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉  我们要去垃圾场\N{\rEng}Alas, we're going to the landfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  加里 \N{\rEng}No worries, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.82,0:21:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丝毫不用担心\N{\rEng}Not a single one in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美女\N{\rEng}Nellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不要激动\N{\rEng}Everybody keep their horses inside the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟我们是朋友\N{\rEng}After all, we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.47,0:21:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\rEng}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.14,0:22:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然说清了这点\N{\rEng}Now that that's out of the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.39,0:22:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们说正事吧\N{\rEng}let's get down to the brass tacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底线是  我需要道歉\N{\rEng}Bottom line, ‭I'm gonna need an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真诚的道歉\N{\rEng}The genuine article.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你跟瑞克有私下交易\N{\rEng}Now, I know you had ‭your little side deal with Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几乎是手拉手来到了我们家\N{\rEng}You came to our home, pretty much arm in arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我们事先已有过约定\N{\rEng}This despite the pre-existing arrangement with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我们看到你了  因为我们想杀了你\N{\rEng}Now you know we saw you, because we tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.06,0:22:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你有足够的时间准备些什么\N{\rEng}So you've had plenty of time to prepare something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望是一段感人肺腑的忏悔\N{\rEng}A heartfelt act of confession, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.33,0:22:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以随意参考事先准备好的笔记\N{\rEng}Feel free to refer to any notes you may have prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.85,0:23:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和瑞克没交易\N{\rEng}No deal with Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送他过去\N{\rEng}Delivered him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给你们\N{\rEng}Brought to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们开枪了\N{\rEng}But you shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.52,0:23:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡扯\N{\rEng}Bull-shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.42,0:23:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不用担心\N{\rEng}But no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.85,0:23:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们走运了\N{\rEng}'Cause you caught yourself a break --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说的话  走大运了\N{\rEng}a big ol' break, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你们重新履行我们说好的协议\N{\rEng}Negan is graciously willing to forgo any punishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.49,0:23:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根就会仁慈地免除一切惩罚\N{\rEng}provided you agree to revert to the agreed-upon terms of our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要这样做\N{\rEng}You do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.34,0:23:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切一笔勾销\N{\rEng}all is forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.90,0:23:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了狗屎运  对吧\N{\rEng}That's some crazy good luck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.65,0:24:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们得收缴你们的枪支弹药\N{\rEng}However, we will be taking all your guns and ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.69,0:24:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,协议中没这条\N{\rEng}Not our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.17,0:24:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.25,0:24:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们现在有这个需求\N{\rEng}But we currently have a need.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.69,0:24:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为盟友  这种善意的举动\N{\rEng}And as friends, you will grant us
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.27,0:24:18.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将被视作忠心的证明\N{\rEng}this neighborly gesture as a sign of good faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都有危险\N{\rEng}Dangers everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.69,0:24:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也需要枪\N{\rEng}Need guns, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.11,0:24:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有我们了\N{\rEng}Not when you got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.86,0:24:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真到了你们需要用枪的时候\N{\rEng}And if and when the time comes for you to have guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.39,0:24:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军自会提供给你们\N{\rEng}the Saviors will provide them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪闪发光  枪况良好\N{\rEng}Spit-shined, ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.38,0:24:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.25,0:25:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你画的吗\N{\rEng}Is this you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.09,0:25:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不赖嘛\N{\rEng}It's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.59,0:25:24.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前学的还是后来学的\N{\rEng}You learn before or after?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.91,0:25:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是学的\N{\rEng}Don't learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这\N{\rEng}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.56,0:25:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与生俱来\N{\rEng}Come to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.47,0:25:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要选垃圾场\N{\rEng}Why the dump?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.95,0:25:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多好地方可以安家\N{\rEng}I mean, there had to be a better place to call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的地方\N{\rEng}Our place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.68,0:25:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的\N{\rEng}Ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.63,0:25:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面的停机坪是怎么回事\N{\rEng}What's the deal with the helipad in back?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.74,0:25:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些太阳能板\N{\rEng}The solar panels?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.45,0:26:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里之前是什么地方\N{\rEng}What was this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.15,0:26:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垃圾场\N{\rEng}A dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.49,0:26:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道你知不知道\N{\rEng}I want to know if you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.38,0:26:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪给你了\N{\rEng}You have guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.12,0:26:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达成协议了吗\N{\rEng}We have deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.12,0:26:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然发现我还没有得到正式的道歉\N{\rEng}It occurs to me that I've not yet received the full definition of an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.01,0:26:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你们似乎承认了背叛\N{\rEng}I feel like I've gotten some transgressional acknowledgment,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.50,0:26:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些枪自然算补偿\N{\rEng}the guns certainly cover restitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.29,0:26:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我还没感觉到\N{\rEng}But what I'm not yet feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.29,0:26:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悔恨\N{\rEng}is the remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.13,0:26:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有悔恨\N{\rEng}There is remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.32,0:27:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有悔恨\N{\rEng}There is remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.74,0:27:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\rEng}Say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.67,0:27:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有悔恨  你个混蛋\N{\rEng}There is remorse, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  不\N{\rEng}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.01,0:27:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你不是真心的\N{\rEng}I don't think you mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.26,0:27:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪吧  兄弟们\N{\rEng}Light it up, gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.54,0:27:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻开枪\N{\rEng}Light it up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.44,0:28:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务完成了吗\N{\rEng}Got it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.89,0:28:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远不止此\N{\rEng}That and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.34,0:28:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\rEng}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.07,0:28:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加文没消息\N{\rEng}Nothing on Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.32,0:28:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让我回头\N{\rEng}Want me to turn back around,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.63,0:28:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再出去一趟查清楚吗 \N{\rEng}roll out, end the mystery?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.70,0:28:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经派一队人去了\N{\rEng}I already sent a team out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他一定没事\N{\rEng}Well, I'm sure he's A-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.42,0:28:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真出事了  我们再警告一次\N{\rEng}And if not, we'll just send another message.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.68,0:28:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我具体过程\N{\rEng}So, tell me how it went.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.79,0:28:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,标准的上门警告\N{\rEng}Standard message and delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过示范让他们知道了\N{\rEng}Showed 'em and told 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.29,0:28:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有悔恨\N{\rEng}There was remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.81,0:28:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根\N{\rEng}Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.86,0:28:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rEng}Yeah. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.34,0:29:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是瑞克\N{\rEng}It's Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.42,0:29:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(1000,0)\fs40\pos(192,171)\c&HD6D6D6&}简迪斯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.78,0:29:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来\N{\rEng}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.65,0:29:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\rEng}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.68,0:30:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么\N{\rEng}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.55,0:30:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世军来了\N{\rEng}The Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.56,0:30:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么出去\N{\rEng}Well, how do we get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.68,0:30:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么进来\N{\rEng}Get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.65,0:30:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就怎么出去\N{\rEng}how you got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.55,0:30:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前没有垃圾山\N{\rEng}These weren't heaps before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.31,0:30:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是垃圾\N{\rEng}It was just trash
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.92,0:30:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一片片铺在地上  看不到尽头\N{\rEng}laid out, as far as the eye could see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.70,0:30:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前常来这里找东西  在上面作画\N{\rEng}I used to come here to find things to paint on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.67,0:30:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金属板\N{\rEng}Metal sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布料\N{\rEng}Fabrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.35,0:30:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来  一切改变之后\N{\rEng}And then after... everything changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.74,0:30:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我意识到  这个地方就是块画布\N{\rEng}I realized this whole place was a canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.35,0:30:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就是颜料\N{\rEng}That we were the paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.15,0:30:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以创造新的事物\N{\rEng}We could create something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.58,0:30:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以成为新的事物\N{\rEng}We could become something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.74,0:31:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们确实变了\N{\rEng}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.32,0:31:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里本是我们的世界\N{\rEng}This was our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.37,0:31:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与其他人都不同\N{\rEng}Apart from everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.24,0:31:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从各方面来说都是\N{\rEng}In every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.28,0:31:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的错\N{\rEng}You did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.15,0:31:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因为你\N{\rEng}This is because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.65,0:31:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.67,0:31:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们冲出去\N{\rEng}We're gonna run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.18,0:31:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我一起走\N{\rEng}Let me come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.90,0:31:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离它们就行\N{\rEng}Just until they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.74,0:32:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.33,0:32:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受够了她的游戏\N{\rEng}I'm done with her games.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.76,0:32:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正她也帮不上我们\N{\rEng}She can't help us, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.19,0:32:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:33:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  求你了  让我出去\N{\rEng}Wait! Please! Just -- Just let me get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.96,0:37:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}苹果酱\N货架存销*20罐
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.71,0:37:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(1000,0)\fs40\pos(192,171)\c&HD6D6D6&}瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.12,0:37:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我朝她头顶开枪  我只想赶她走\N{\rEng}I shot above her head. I just wanted her gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.92,0:37:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到她了  她安全了\N{\rEng}Look, I saw her. She made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.46,0:37:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走之前她跑进了空巷子里\N{\rEng}She ran into an empty alley just before I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.53,0:38:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想让她死\N{\rEng}I didn't want her dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.22,0:38:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想让她走\N{\rEng}I just wanted her gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉这就是卡尔所说的事\N{\rEng}Feels like ‭what Carl was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.19,0:38:16.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当有选择时  我们该做什么\N{\rEng}What we should do when we have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.84,0:38:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要点时间\N{\rEng}I need a se-- I need a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.09,0:38:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\rEng}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.12,0:39:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.22,0:39:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}尼根
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.07,0:39:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}尼根  我是卡尔...\N我被咬了...\N我知道你变成这样是被迫的...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让尼根通话\N{\rEng}Get me Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.05,0:40:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\rEng}Who the hell is asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.12,0:40:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克·格兰姆斯\N{\rEng}It's Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.89,0:40:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克  瞧你还给我打电话呢\N{\rEng}Ricky. Look at you, callin' me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.23,0:40:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如告诉我你在哪\N{\rEng}You wanna tell me where you are
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.64,0:40:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们当面谈谈吧\N{\rEng}so we can do this face-to-face?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.23,0:40:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔死了\N{\rEng}Carl's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.02,0:40:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他写了很多信\N{\rEng}He wrote letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.92,0:40:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一封是给你的\N{\rEng}He wrote one to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.61,0:40:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要你停下\N{\rEng}He asked you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.18,0:40:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要我停下\N{\rEng}He asked me to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.45,0:40:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要我们休战\N{\rEng}He asked us for peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.69,0:40:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在太迟了\N{\rEng}But it's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.78,0:41:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我们想谈和  也没意义了\N{\rEng}Even if we wanted a deal now, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.69,0:41:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\rEng}I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.93,0:41:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\rEng}How did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.16,0:41:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rEng}‭What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.29,0:41:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么死的\N{\rEng}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.03,0:41:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们吗\N{\rEng}Was it us?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.97,0:41:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是手榴弹吗\N{\rEng}Was it the grenades?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大火吗\N{\rEng}The fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.82,0:41:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你们\N{\rEng}It wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.44,0:41:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔出去帮别人\N{\rEng}Carl went out to help someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.56,0:41:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被咬了\N{\rEng}And he got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.49,0:41:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\rEng}God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.67,0:41:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的  我很遗憾\N{\rEng}Shit. I, um...I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.16,0:41:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要他加入我\N{\rEng}You know, I wanted him to be part of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.69,0:41:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我定了计划\N{\rEng}I had plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.68,0:42:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子\N{\rEng}He -- That kid --
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.09,0:42:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子是未来\N{\rEng}That kid was the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.98,0:42:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你死了才有未来\N{\rEng}The only future is one where you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.71,0:42:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底在做什么  瑞克\N{\rEng}What the hell are you doing, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.01,0:42:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么反抗  你为什么增加难度\N{\rEng}Why are you fighting? Why are you making this so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.20,0:42:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你害死了卡尔\N{\rEng}Carl is dead because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.32,0:42:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你非要没事找事\N{\rEng}Because you couldn't leave shit well enough alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.78,0:42:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说不定以后也会因别的而死\N{\rEng}I mean, hell, maybe he woulda died some other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.13,0:42:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们任何人都可能随时蹬腿\N{\rEng}Any one of us can get our ticket punched at any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.40,0:42:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但就这情况来说\N{\rEng}but in this case --
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.99,0:42:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这情况来说\N{\rEng}in this case...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.52,0:42:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是被你害死的\N{\rEng}he is dead because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.30,0:42:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你没能在场阻止他做傻事\N{\rEng}Because you weren't there to stop him ‭from doing something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.73,0:42:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头是你起的  瑞克\N{\rEng}You set this course, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.34,0:42:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个死的是谁\N{\rEng}Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.50,0:42:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\rEng}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.92,0:42:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但会是某人\N{\rEng}But someone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.39,0:42:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞧  我阻止了人们死去\N{\rEng}You see, I stop people from dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.50,0:42:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是终极答案\N{\rEng}I am the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.83,0:43:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许沉痛的教训才能让你意识到\N{\rEng}Now, it may have taken a hard lesson for you to hear it,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.38,0:43:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你该意识到了\N{\rEng}but you should hear it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.89,0:43:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时候到了\N{\rEng}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.40,0:43:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再让你的错误决定\N{\rEng}Do not let any more of your shit decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.56,0:43:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害死你爱的其他人了\N{\rEng}cost you to lose anyone else you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.68,0:43:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那烂摊子\N{\rEng}That garbage...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.32,0:43:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的重担\N{\rEng}that sticks with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.51,0:43:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到永远\N{\rEng}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.99,0:43:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像卡尔一样\N{\rEng}Just like Carl will.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.11,0:43:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼  我也难受\N{\rEng}Hell, I'm feeling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.47,0:43:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会难受很久的\N{\rEng}And I'm gonna be feeling it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.21,0:43:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本可以让我拯救你们所有人\N{\rEng}You could have just let me save all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.05,0:43:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我当初才杀了你的朋友们\N{\rEng}I mean, that why I killed your friends in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.61,0:43:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以坐在那里\N{\rEng}So, you can sit there
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.79,0:43:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么你要杀了我\N{\rEng}and you can say ‭that you're gonna kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.80,0:43:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你杀不了\N{\rEng}but you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.87,0:43:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失败了\N{\rEng}You failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.40,0:43:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个失败的领袖\N{\rEng}You failed as a leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.30,0:43:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更重要的是  瑞克  你是个失败的父亲\N{\rEng}and most of all, Rick, you failed as a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.91,0:43:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃吧\N{\rEng}Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.33,0:44:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃吧  因为你已经输了\N{\rEng}Give up, because you have already lost.
